Z||000000||fierovette||07-25-2001||10:20 AM||||My 88GT has a switch on the overhead, was told its for the sub woofer. Has a slide switch/w MIN.&MAX. I hear no difference between the MIN. & Max. Is there a way to check to see if it does work? Maybe it dosent work with my 60's music.||||reg||5
