Z||000010||Haagster||07-26-2001||02:24 PM||||I got the factory sub working with my Alpine CD player.  The thing that I did was take the blue wire from the GM adapter and spicing it with the red wire (powers the amp).<P>BTW: I also got the sub speaker kit from Rodney Dickman.  It works great.<p>[This message has been edited by Haagster (edited 07-26-2001).]||||reg||6
